145	// RadioModeEnabled is a helper for the controller's PATCH side-effect
146	// (`redisAdapter.cache.lavalink.setPlayerPersistent`). Returns nil when the
147	// PATCH body omits `radio_mode` entirely; otherwise a pointer to the new value.
148	//
