150	// pointers, so a body carrying `radio_mode` ALWAYS sets `enabled` - omitting
151	// the field inside it means `false`. That is not a quirk of this helper: `Set`
152	// above writes that same `false` to Mongo, so the two destinations stay in
153	// step. The shared TS type (`library-shared/src/db/schemas/DBGuildSchemas.ts`)
